@Finance_API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5106
@Finance_API_HostAddress_Https = https://localhost:7056
@token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..GFLUBbBaOqMKS9rOFOlInKReS0Hm1k-HUuMGO1TiHro
  
### Check API and database readiness
GET {{Finance_API_HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### Not found responses use Problem Details
GET {{Finance_API_HostAddress}}/api/not-a-route
Accept: application/problem+json

### Register a new user
POST {{Finance_API_HostAddress_Https}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "alice",
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "password": "P@ssword1"
}

### Login and receive a JWT token
POST {{Finance_API_HostAddress_Https}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "alice",
  "password": "P@ssword1"
}

### Example protected endpoint using the returned token
### Replace {{token}} with the value returned from the login request
GET {{Finance_API_HostAddress_Https}}/api/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

